  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abbd95a7c6c4e83716272cc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「安定感」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef5e21ca36c6e5120e1b44bcf8366b7c95d23e8bd3b6b3c5eef6e93478084ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07de1a3205d6f18e26eda43a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「准备完美的赛马娘」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b3f88518046a6e9be55b8a0814b86f5596bb076c8655fb6b29af8c5f1d4aef0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf0522f290ce16660658cfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「不必多言」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c71442ed53a114c59d656d7fef108fc21bc123d0f4599fe415a295327a4953",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc877266c72ea69a6bb74c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「般配的继承」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2c36c584cf623e5dc8f2062372a3810b952eea9b4084fce713fa1b0943dff88",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78afd75bfc010643346a05a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「Golden Boot」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e94ddbbc9ef076efffcbf64797adf58b6757a57af709c31585c911cc28f57d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee0a12abda78c48e47fe765",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「次世代引擎」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23db35753675533040150baeb0d9840c02b7ef2793d45186a223f3fb9adc7d5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50233c07472f411eb2dce7c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「肌肉万岁」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c1b92ff2215c05cc721429a8f24f84bdc8900c90e0e994adee0da8f205cc83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b90b48ff056a2b1cbc4ae99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「最爱体育精神」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8533ecf4570ec6445d0fb7d677063c675ff184489262803d51f9fc0ce4f8d779",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7148f163680b1eb1b22fe7df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「幕后人」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51288bbb61e67f43fb938f2f716d80bc8522d217491962467070d00ad8111d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2459cc4e388db5874e1d50b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「大奖冠军二世」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91adc2d20911922268497e881a4e360f000936d1d3e7b86ade989b09d4170b8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4a0262a6905a33653607c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「笑料般的继承」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f79d1a99aed8f8439b568e3e1436fecbd87f2e8267f2aeb6d9dbe975de8f8b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b8d243b212e725255bc8bed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「精英赛马娘」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89716a97d25e1ad46d600f142be3b17985b76d1a537454ee8ee4e8ae614534ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58bcbd4b961de8b09a55c2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「无败的谱系」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0743c33815b314643e615ff56cb62f198ef5c8b45e2e3e975e475c4ac9467ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1a3511f89d26b5601b9665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「反抗期」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e02bf060b9cde9f975ac0e5936798b6fb5282386641f3b970f838c2817268c5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5dd5cbc3afe8a5582e62872",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「王者的精神」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c599abeecc5bad29f779cc0c16718060065d71094eb1aa2182c1a0d3337e5ed2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7597e7f8c69c33cb334524f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「真·王者的精神」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c2fa2e4aaa9cde20ece2c080fd985c2e0fcdee7f0ae23f0fdde08bfe36c0a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ebaca237223bedee535e2c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「突然变异」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b082e39e87376fdd474d39e566e320e350739d7f20b4cb0c3008433dfcba948",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50cd8a8b7f6b7c8c92cc031e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「女王的精神」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d68c7642d13b736d919007da444df2f1f0e796dbde1cfd68bb1a9ae8a303b91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae49ca3f64af5c2d786568f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「真·女王的精神」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa0ecad95db578d04423c81678f5d58be25d551bfc9bf9a1c6b01652edafcae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f1573de6a690cbd63a695e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「时代的宠儿」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acfe1a65695a55d1e23c8a5d3d3c59a9ce624df0ddc2a6eb31654788fd4b87c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5ba83d4fc92993258e0e3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "但就如同她的别称「胜利的探索者」，是相当具有实力的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6c98de71e3ca482c0d64999e469d231662cab01fa825202000f3190618e4cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "510127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572168c4d3bdaeaefaa34e12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使面对盛大舞台也毫不紧张的表现，美到让人忍不住看得入迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d7770424117c239efc120237d61420902759c79cb4269b104913c809dee50a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "5102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9dd8948bcf6dd97fd62c93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次也能充分发挥坚强实力吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e39948b7f245df45f6cebc86c307d62a5bb9736d84d645c8841bf9d60470e53d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "5200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5449b8e8ace58158290e034",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "1人夺取3胜的壮举值得期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3784336cce59196ac216ca660fde4240ff19e2dbd0400fb0c7f7cea490f463",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "5201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41039dc262a1dea37634e394",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待她在这场盛大竞赛的活跃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb2b7c1c03dce5436f65306b5bf5a38631928e2fcf340708c783ea18adf00978",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "5202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b19e5fe3b07c8ed4c777995",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<trainer_name>」</color>的热门招牌赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d922ab5a8dd160b8075cae72edb022ddf63440e58596397f1521f4648325b9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:176b97eb0da063ab32fb71f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "4战3胜，大受关注的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8009102a29f91f18d282c3eed97bb62806ce481a668ce1e926726dde59b733",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddcff0c305dc7130a1fa9eee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经1人夺取3胜的惊人赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cd07774bb50b2b30a02c6402d78996e0dca55e9dec130723a7750b6ddd477b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eee15d1d5e233f22a9d73f8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是实力非凡的超级强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56cee4641cfd7d9e6b80ad301a73415df2442abb7ae208f39715b4a763a738a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f20844410b57509895518b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拥有光是让粉丝看着就能感到放心的坚强实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "590e73ff5bdd8d54a6797121dca3830414ef622a3378248dae28511486ec1170",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0579302b17dd14e194f2096d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "除了坚强的能力，运气也支持着她迈向巨星之道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e6b2ca003b5f03616ed35f800396fe77ce542be5ce0c322efc2c3b5a460f74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c21e27bfb2eb3269f5e44d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待在这次大赛大显身手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "524ef604e1696be9e9aea55640a2b16a1bf7ccd85face21879fc8b2e7f3b822d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537b7faf58d9e04bef9785f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次也能展现符合众人期待的表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8ac4a323549f4a02770689860bf4300b845be3a24714e448468572b5bb2f0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69900084e6097a0f56c30c39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝不能错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6801ca6cfb11fda0d2f1f4cb38785ff4b599114ca0964221e24b0c0e110c35b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "6202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0127926d02fcf52ef549ded",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还没有尝过败绩，程度超凡的强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eda9e7f16a36910cb1a034ef927cf54111e05b06bd4573b950b128f4b182fe1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aed693abbf87bd86db2c8f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前所向无敌的超受瞩目赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9c604232782922134e79dc5b225639f07ec0260c2cba96f94b89528ac508f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fe880fe06a047f529754cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color>全胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea64863513dcba1489fd9919ea1a5ad7a35900390115094956fffa9ad2292505",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4701d1f6c37a0528d6f825",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛对手也只能感叹自己签运太差。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6138c765f5e95857c198de8c97c737de0a70651dd65e3534594bfc30ead52fec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8265091bfba40b44e71a4db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其压倒性实力让全国粉丝都看得目不转睛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01412c8ea35bc0253a2b397acf2c0ced29f3834d1c52589abd1f9f4ea4ddb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3567131d88884a145300cab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实现无败绩的坚强实力，丰富的经验，还有竞赛时的优秀技术。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bd7c6d09a312228bb709805553ea83d3bb0f95de99b324c6611603e8125e46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5d82a1cb22f4ab260d58c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无败之路会持续到何时？拭目以待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ca18b87c7b15d1a7e4e24f64f531e2b86decff858d0a0773b1c4d9e0ac3666",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f472bbadcbe98183d1a4b7b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待毫无破绽的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3871d359511ab50cea082ae03b1be2a6c10dbf816e1b9e75890be9132ec06bba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0045e2c590f19fc39ed88b50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够过关斩将到何时呢？让我们亲眼见证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b190f413f771dbd891011c4acbb1587dd76ce2eaaeb1451f94c2072bf07dbcfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "203",
        "7202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839755a2d8aeb3afec0b7b89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对支持你的粉丝说句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a9a2f814783e93d18d5e700918a58315f57dbc941972f0d027258e78fcdb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfea52f56d4f0b43efd5d54d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "透过每日训练有什么发现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "158508bde08f033576c576870118b298918084c06ffc9eb7c8238dd346e5190b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17ad92e5878e4daca5f4e253",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向祈望你获得胜利的粉丝说说你的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "278c8eb06cd3ab091707d309e605f0454cf6b8f508dda63fe0578674a21e2a6e",
